    :hasSentimentScore 0.0516 ;
    :hasTextContent "After a decade, recording the first time I'm going back to [REDACTED] and have a beer after, without using a [REDACTED]. It still hurts (and it's not a little), but between weakening the pain with [REDACTED] treatment, lifestyle changes, and personal growth, today, the pain didn't take away my smile, so I won this battle. A small victory, but one that I think is worthy of celebration" ;
